(disappears at night, and our eyes adjust without being asked.) Tj T*
(A screen must learn the same manners: warm tones after dusk,) Tj T*
(black that is actually black, and a brightness control that) Tj T*
(behaves like a dimmer rather than a switch.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
(This is why the reader carries a filter for the canvas, a) Tj T*
(sepia wash for long sessions, a night palette for low light,) Tj T*
(and a true black theme that keeps the panel quiet on OLED) Tj T*
(displays.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
(None of this is decoration. Each choice removes a small) Tj T*
(friction that, multiplied by a thousand pages, becomes) Tj T*
(fatigue.) Tj T*
