(Nobody remembers a book evenly. Memory is uneven, local, and) Tj T*
(stubborn: a page number, a folded corner, a sentence) Tj T*
(underlined with a fingernail.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
(A reader that remembers the exact place you left, and can) Tj T*
(bring you back to it in a single tap, is worth more than a) Tj T*
(shelf of features you will never open.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
