0 -34.00 Td
(Design for reading is mostly subtraction. Remove the badge,) Tj T*
(the banner, the streak counter, the unread dot. What remains) Tj T*
(should be a page, a place, and a way home.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
(The interface can still be beautiful. It can be soft, rounded,) Tj T*
(tinted by the same wallpaper as the rest of the phone. It can) Tj T*
(move with the patience of something that is not trying to be) Tj T*
(noticed.) Tj T*
/F2 11 Tf 0.18 0.18 0.20 rg 14.6 TL
0 -16.00 Td
(That is the whole brief, really. Serve the text. Stay out of) Tj T*
(the way. Be there when the hand comes back.) Tj T*
